ace, hangout, and unique hand movement-based locomotion.\n\nYou can enjoy games like:\n\n# Sky Park \ud83c\udf88\ud83e\uddd7\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\ud83e\ude81\n\nExplore an elevated playground for climbing, flying, racing, and blaster battles, with challenging rewards to collect.\n\n{758726772714938}\n\n# Maze Out \ud83d\udc79\ud83e\udd2f\n\nNavigate a monster-filled maze, either finding keys for escape or causing mischief for others, all while hunting for loot.\n\n{452608070564989}\n\n# Flag of Honour \ud83c\udff3\ufe0f \ud83d\udca3\n\nDefend the flag from relentless bomb attacks in this intense game requiring teamwork to succeed, with competitive scoring against friends.\n\n{1106201633989177}\n\nAnd more games are coming soon!\n\n# Flex Your Looks \ud83e\udd20\u2620\ufe0f\ud83e\udd21\ud83d\ude0e\ud83c\udfa9\ud83d\udc51\n\n Plus, customize your avatar with over 70 animated cosmetics, offering 500+ combinations to showcase your style. \n\n# Join Hammer Heads community - \nhttps://discord.gg/YYba9rb9n4\n\nStay sharp, and always watch your head!\n\n", "short_description": "Hammer Heads is a VR multiplayer game with multiple game modes like escape, survive, defend, race, hangout, and unique hand movement-based locomotion.\n\nYou can enjoy games like:\n- Sky Park\n- Maze Out\n- Flag Of Honour\n\nAnd more games are coming soon! \n\nPlus, customize your avatar with over 70 animated cosmetics, offering 500+ combinations to showcase your style. Stay sharp, and always watch your he\n\nStay sharp, and always watch your head!\nDiscord -  https://discord.gg/YYba9rb9n4\n\n"}]}, "developer_name": "DopaMind Games", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://dopamindgames.com/index.php/privacy-policy-hammer-heads/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "DopaMind Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://dopamindgames.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534",